<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! carriage.bundle.imports ~ the return: an exported bundle verifies whole, previews, then lands as fresh acts

`import <dest>` verifies every hash and path in the bundle before anything moves, then PREVIEWS and stops. `--apply` replays the re-declare list as fresh acts, maps each bundle face to the ONE face here that carries its pet-name (none or two refuse by name), re-pours the working and face canon rows through the ingest gesture (a diverged id stands off and never overwrites), re-lifts the kahua heads under the new face's grant, keyed by title and body digest, and lands draft and temp files where none stands.

A journal under `<root>/config` lets an interrupted import re-enter to the same end, and a second import lands nothing. A face standing shut waits: the lines name `lares vault unlock face=N`, then import again; a workbench lands at the wear of a face that holds a writer's seat there. The exit reads 0 clean, `verb-error` where a row refused, `conflict` where a row stood off.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ preview · apply

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`preview` params=`dest/./house-keep ~ verify the bundle and name what would land; nothing moves`>>
<<has entity=`example` name=`apply` params=`dest/./house-keep apply/true ~ replay the re-declare list and land the rows`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ dest · apply

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`dest` params=`takes/dir needs/required seat/1 as/<dest> ~ the bundle directory an export wrote`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`apply` params=`~ land the rows; absent, a preview that verifies the bundle and writes nothing`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ write · signs

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`write` params=`who/hand ~ --apply writes records and re-lifts kahua heads, each lift signing under the new face's grant; a person runs it at their own terminal`>>
<<has entity=`gate` name=`signs` params=`key/face-grant ~ the re-lifts sign kahua acts under the face's grant`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · bundle-refused · face-waiting

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[carriage.bundle.imports dest/<dest>]] ~ the bundle directory stands required`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`bundle-refused` params=`cure/[[carriage.bundle.imports dest/<dest>]] ~ a hash or path failed to verify, or two faces carry one pet-name; nothing moved`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`face-waiting` params=`~ a face stands shut or unworn; the line names lares vault unlock face=N, then import again`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ previewed · applied · stood-off · refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`previewed` params=`exit/0 fields/[[bundleId applied faceMap redeclare minted tallies skipped waiting warnings]] ~ the bundle verified whole; the tallies name what would land`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`applied` params=`exit/0 ~ every row landed or stood already`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`stood-off` params=`exit/conflict ~ a row stood off against a diverged id; nothing overwrote it`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`refused` params=`exit/verb-error ~ a row refused; the lines name each`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares import

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares import]] ~ the terminal; the bundle directory rides as <dest>`>>
```

